
This folder contains some useful tools for developers:

  create_test.php         -  Creates a class test template from a header file.
                             This tool relies on doxygen XML output; build it first with
                             'cmake --build <build-dir> --target doc_xml'.

  correct_test.php        -  Helps the user to correct BEGIN_SECTION macros.
                             Function names inside the BEGIN_SECTION macros are automatically replaced by
                             the correct declarations in the header file.
                             This tool relies on doxygen XML output; build it first with
                             'cmake --build <build-dir> --target doc_xml'.

Note: All php scripts are executed by calling them as argument of the php interpreter.

For information on how to create tests for new classes, see the developer documentation
in doc/doxygen/public/developer_faq.doxygen (section "How to add a new class test").
